  "settings.prof.flagLegal": { en: "Flag for admin review — business name and registration number appear on your invoices as legal identity. Check this so an admin is notified of the change.", pidgin: "Flag am for admin review — business name and registration number dey show for your invoice as your legal identity. Tick this one so admin go know say you change am.", ha: "Yi alama don bitar admin — sunan kasuwanci da lambar rajista suna bayyana a rasit ɗinka a matsayin shaidar doka. Duba wannan don a sanar da admin game da canjin.", ig: "Kaa akara maka nyocha admin — aha azụmaahịa na nọmba ndebanye na-apụta n'akwụkwọ ụgwọ gị dịka njirimara iwu. Kaa nke a ka a gwa admin maka mgbanwe ahụ.", yo: "Sàmì sí i fún àyẹ̀wò admin — orúkọ iṣẹ́ òwò àti nọ́ńbà ìforúkọsílẹ̀ máa ń hàn lórí ìwé-owó rẹ gẹ́gẹ́ bí ìdánimọ̀ lábẹ́ òfin. Sàmì sí èyí kí admin lè mọ̀ nípa àyípadà náà." },
