  "settings.acct.pc.regDocHint": { en: "Your CAC certificate, business name certificate or any government registration document. Take a clear photo with all four corners showing, or choose an image (JPG or PNG).", pidgin: "Your CAC certificate, business name certificate or any government registration paper. Snap clear photo wey all the four corners show, or choose picture (JPG or PNG).", ha: "Takardar shaidar CAC, takardar sunan kasuwanci ko kowace takardar rajista ta gwamnati. Ɗauki hoto mai kyau da ke nuna dukkan kusurwoyi huɗu, ko zaɓi hoto (JPG ko PNG).", ig: "Asambodo CAC gị, asambodo aha azụmaahịa ma ọ bụ akwụkwọ ndebanye aha gọọmentị ọ bụla. See foto doro anya nke akụkụ anọ niile na-egosi, ma ọ bụ họrọ onyonyo (JPG ma ọ bụ PNG).", yo: "Ìwé-ẹ̀rí CAC rẹ, ìwé-ẹ̀rí orúkọ iṣẹ́ òwò tàbí ìwé ìforúkọsílẹ̀ ìjọba èyíkéyìí. Ya fọ́tò tó mọ́ kedere tí gbogbo igun mẹ́rẹ̀ẹ̀rin hàn, tàbí yan àwòrán (JPG tàbí PNG)." },
